
# positive lookahead (?=) -> ex: A(?=B) -> finds expression A where expression B follows 13 
# negative lookahead (?!) -> ex: A(?!B) -> finds expression A where expression B does not follow
# positive lookbehind (?<=) -> ex: (?<=B)A -> finds expression A where expression B precedes.
# negative lookbehind (?<!) -> ex: (?<!B)A -> finds expression A where expresion B does not precede.


